WEBVTT

00:02:26.836 --> 00:02:32.396
because I wanted to understand
what frameworks exist to negotiate

00:02:32.436 --> 00:02:35.436
who gets to produce what and how much;

00:02:35.476 --> 00:02:38.436
what policies help governments regulate,

00:02:38.476 --> 00:02:41.716
constrain the production side
of fossil fuels.

00:02:42.236 --> 00:02:45.116
I found out that very few do.

00:02:46.276 --> 00:02:48.636
I will never forget the day

00:02:48.636 --> 00:02:51.316
that I sat with the Paris Agreement

00:02:51.356 --> 00:02:53.996
and I searched for the words

00:02:54.036 --> 00:02:55.716
fossil fuels,

00:02:55.756 --> 00:02:59.276
oil, gas, coal.